$NetBSD$

Run the 1998 HolliDance with "hollidance-1998", which prints its frame
rate on standard output.

The strobe light effect stays off: the NoStrobe file, which "hollidance-1998"
always keeps in place, disables it, because strobing light can cause
seizures in people with epilepsy.

